{
  "id": "DEU.28",
  "number": "28",
  "bookId": "DEU",
  "reference": "Obwijukiro 28",
  "verseCount": 68,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "28",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 28"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "28",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kamulihulira eby'Omukama Ruhanga wanyu alikubaragira, nimwegendeleza kukwata emihangoye yona eyo ndikubaragira kir'eki, alibatungika eiguru y'amahanga gona g'ensi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kamulihulira eby'Omukama Ruhanga wanyu alikubaragira n'emigisha egi yona eliba yanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama aliha endimiro zanyu n'ekigo kyanyu omugisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alibatunga abana n'emyaka n'ente n'entaama zingi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Entukuru zanyu n'enyato zanyu z'okukandiramu alibiha omugisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alitunga omugisha ebyo mulikora byona.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ababisha banyu abalibatabalira Omukama alibasinga. Balibatabalira balesirwe omuhanda gumoi, kandi omu kubairuka balitwarwa emihanda mushanju. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emilimo yanyu aligiha omugisha, n'esitoa zanyu azijuze emyaka. Alibaha omugisha omu nsi ey'Omukama Ruhanga wanyu alikubaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama alibataho mube ihangalye elitakatifu, nk'okwo yabanahiliire kamulyekomya emihangoye mukakora eby'alikwenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'amahanga gona g'ensi galibona Omukama yabaronkire kamuba ihangalye, mara galibatina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama alibatunga abana bangi n'ebitunganwa, n'emyaka mulyeza nyingi omu nsi mwonene ey'Omukama yanahiliire baisheinywe okwo aligibaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alibagwisiza enjura omu kirumo kyayo n'emilimo yanyu yona aligiha omugisha. Mulihora amahanga gangi kyonkai inywe timulyehoza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi alibahindura batwazi, timulitwarwa. Muliikara mugoshokire timulizaha kamulihulira emihango y'Omukama Ruhanga wanyu, eyo ndikubaragira kir'eki, mukegendeleza kugikwata, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mukaikara muli besigwa aha byo ndikubaragira kir'eki, mutahigire baruhanga bandi kubafukamira.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kyonkai kamuliba mutahuliire eby'Omukama Ruhanga wanyu alikubaragira, anga mutegendeleize kukwata mihangoye yona n'ebiragirobye ebyo ndikubaragira kir'eki, aho emiraamo egi yona elibagwera ebakwate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama aliraama ebigo byanyu n'endimiro zanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aliraama entukuru zanyu n'enyato zanyu z'okukandiramu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alibaraama abahe abana bake, emyaka mweze mike, n'ebitunganwa byanyu by'entaama n'ente tibilikanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebyo mulikora byona alibiraama.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kamulikora kubi mukaruga aha Mukama, alibasindikira emiraamo, ebyo mulikora byona mulibikora nimubumbulikwa nimwekanasha, mara babasilikye muhweho bwangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aliikara abasindikire endwara mulemwe muhwe inywena omu nsi eyo mulikutahamu kulya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alibarwaza orufuba n'omushwago, mubujuke emibili murwaire eibugumo; omushana gujwe ogwa ibarura, habeho n'omushana gw'eilimbe n'obukuku; bilibazigilira mulemwe muhweho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eiguru lilitukura nk'omulinga, n'ensi egumangane nk'ekyoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensi eliburwa enjura, elibasindikira orutumulira n'echuchu, byeme eiguru bibaragalire mulemwe musilike. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama alibaihyamu emikono, ababisha banyu babasinge. Mulibatabalira mwemire rubaju rumoi, kandi aha kusingwa mulitwarwa emihanda mushanju; mara omu ngoma zona z'ensi muliba kinyamununge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emitumbi yanyu elilibwa ebinyonyi n'ebigunju, mara thaliho n'omoi alibitinisa kabigenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alibateza ebihute bya Misiri, n'ebironda, n'enfumbi, n'obuhere n'okurumwarumwa ebyo mutakutambirwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alibarwaza eiraru, abahumise, mara mubumbulikwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulikarakanja omw'ihangwe, nk'okwo empume ekarakanja omu mwilima. N'ebyo mulikora tibiligoshoka. Mulishaijuruzibwa n'okunyagwa obutosha, mara thaliho n'omoi alibajuna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulishelera abakazi kyonkai bashwerwe bashaija bandi. Mwombeke amaju kyonkai timuligaturamu. Mulime endimiro z'emizabibu kyonkai timulizilyaho zabibu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ente zanyu balizibaitira omu maisho, kyonkai timulizilyaho nyama. Endogobe zanyu zilitwarwa rwamani mulebire, mara timulizibona rundi. Entama zanyu baliziha ababisha banyu, kyonkai thaliho n'omoi alibajuna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abana banyu balitwarwa eihanga elindi mulebire kushai, mujunare ekiro kyona, kandi timuligira mani ga kubatanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eihanga elyo mutalikumanya lililya byona ebyo muliba mwelize omu mpiita, mushube mwikare nimushaijuruzibwa kushai n'okubonesibwa enaku obutosha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebyo mulibona ebyo bililemwa bibararure. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama alibateza ebihute ebilikunena muno aha majwi n'aha maguru, kwema omu kilenge kugoba aha mutwe, mara tibilitambwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inywe n'omukama wanyu owo mulitaho, alibatwara omw'ihanga ly'abanyamahanga elyo baisheinywe batamanyaga. Kulinya mulifukamira baruhanga abandi ab'emiti n'amabare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muliba kinyamununge babachweho omugani mara babageye omu mahanga gona mbali Omukama alibanaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulibiba bingi omu misiri, kyonkai muligeshamu bike, aha rw'okuba enzige zilibilya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulibyara emizabibu n'okugishakulira, kyonkai timuligihururaho zabibu kuginywaho divai, aha rw'okuba eliliibwa ekihuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu nsi yanyu yona mulilima endimiro y'emizeituni, kyonkai timulyesiiga majuta, ahakuba ezeituni zayo ziliragara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulizara abana, kyonkai tibaliba banyu aha rw'okuba balinyagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enzige zilikuuta emiti yanyu yona n'ebyo muliba mwelize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omufuruki aliba abafurukiiremu aligenda nabatungama aha mutwe; kandi inywe muligenda nimutentena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alibahora kyonkai inywe timulimuhora. Aliba mukama kyonkai inywe muliba batwarwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emiraamo egi yona elibakwata mulemwe musilike, enshonga y'okutahulira byo Mukama Ruhanga wanyu alikubaragira, kukwata emihangoye n'ebiragirobye ebyo yabaragire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebibonabonyio ebyo inywe na baijukuru banyu mulibijukiraho ebiro byona.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omukama Ruhanga wanyu abatungire omugisha omuli byona, mwaburwa kumukolera n'ebyera n'amashemelerwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo mulikolera babisha ab'Omukama alibasindikira. Muligira enjara n'eiliho muburwe n'eky'okujwara, muburabulirwe buli kantu. Alibakoma enkomo y'ekyoma omu bikya, alemwe abasilikye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama aliihya eihanga harai muno libatabalire, obwangu nk'okwo malere eharara, eihanga elyo mutalikushobokerwa rulimi rwalyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ely'obuso bukambire, elitalifaho mugurusi anga mwana, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lililya ebitunganwa byanyu n'emyaka eyo muliba mwelize, mulemwe musilike. Tililibasigira mwaka, divai anga majuta, n'ebitunganwa chei, n'entama chei. Ahanyuma balemwe babasilikye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balibabundira omu bigo byanyu byona, eboma eziraizirai ezo mwesiga zilikumba omu nsi yanyu ey'Omukama Ruhanga wanyu yabahaire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulilya abana banyu abo mwezaliire, ab'Omukama abatungire, aha rw'ababisha banyu kubabunda bakabashasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omushaija omufura muno alezirwege aliima omurumuna ekyakulya, n'omukazi omugonzibwawe, nangu n'omwana w'enzindo ow'aliba asigaizeho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Talikunda kubahaho nyama y'abaanabe ab'alikulya, aha rw'okuba talisigarwaho kantu orw'omubisha alibabundira omu bigo byanyu akabashasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukazi omufura muno alezirwege, atakuzilize kuteka kilengekye aha itaka aha rw'obunyiginya n'obuyonjobwe, aliima iba omugonzibwawe, aime n'omutabani n'omuhara, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abaime n'enda ya nyuma, alibaima n'abana ab'alizara, aha rw'okuba alibalya ayeshelekire. Enshonga ebintu byona bilibura orwo alibabunda akabashasa omu bigo byanyu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.57"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.57"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "58",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:58"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "58",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kamuliba mutegendeleize kukwata Mateka aga gona agahandikirwe omu kitabo eki mukatina Omukama Ruhanga wanyu ow'eibara ly'ekitinwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.58",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.58"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "59",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:59"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "59",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aho inywe n'abana banyu Omukama alibateza enaku ezitakabonekaga, enaku n'endwara ezibi mara ezitali za kuhwaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.59",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.59"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "60",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:60"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "60",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi alishuba abaletere endwara zona za Misiri ezo mwatinaga, zibaberezo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.60",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.60"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "61",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:61"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "61",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alibaletera buli ndwara na buli naku ebitahandikwe mu kitabo eki ky'Amateka, mulemwe musilike. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.61",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.61"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "62",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:62"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "62",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'orwo mubaire muli bangi nk'enyanyinyi, mulisigaraho bake, orwo mutalikuhulira eby'Omukama Ruhanga wanyu alikubaragira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.62",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.62"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "63",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:63"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "63",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi okwo yashemelerwaga kubakolera ebirungi mara akabahindura bangi, nikwo alishemelerwa kubainaza akabasilikya. N'ensi eyo mulikutahamu kulya aligibakunyuramu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.63",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.63"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "64",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:64"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "64",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alibanaganaga omu mahanga omu nsi zona, mugye mukolere baruhanga abandi ab'emiti n'amabare, abo mutamanya, na baisheinywe tibabamanyire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.64",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.64"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "65",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:65"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "65",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu mahanga aga timulibonamu bwikarage, nangu n'obuhumuzo bw'ekilenge bwonkai timulibubonamu. Alibachundizayo emitima abalerembulireyo amaisho, abafundagatanisizeyo emyoyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.65",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.65"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "66",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:66"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "66",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulirora nimuhwahwana, nyemishana n'ekiro mwikare omu rumatu, timuligira na mbali mwasimbisiza burora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.66",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.66"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "67",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:67"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "67",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwankya muligamba muti, ‘Isi kuba bw'aba buli bwaigoro!’ Kandi bwaigoro muti, ‘Isi kuba bw'aba buli bwankya!’ Aha rw'enshonga y'orumatu orwo muligira, n'ebyo mulibona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.67",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.67"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "68",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:68"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "68",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama alibagarura Misiri abashubiseyo emeli, n'orwo yagambiire okwo atalibagarurayo rundi. Omu nsi eyo mulyehongera ababisha banyu kubagura mukahinduka bairu n'abazana, kyonkai thaliho muntu alibagura.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.68",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.68"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
